#: appEditors/appGeoEditor.py:7440 appEditors/geo_plugins/GeoBufferPlugin.py:94
#: appEditors/geo_plugins/GeoBufferPlugin.py:111
#: appEditors/geo_plugins/GeoBufferPlugin.py:128
#: appEditors/grb_plugins/GrbBufferPlugin.py:98
