#: appPlugins/ToolMilling/MillingUI.py:1165
msgid ""
"The height Z to which the tool will rise in order to avoid\n"
"an interdiction area."
msgstr ""
"Az a Z magasság, amelyre az eszköz felemelkedik\n"
