#: appPlugins/ToolExtract/Extract.py:584
#: appPlugins/ToolInvertGerber/InvertGerber.py:300
#: appPlugins/ToolSub/Sub.py:560
msgid "Generating new object failed."
msgstr "Az új objektum létrehozása sikertelen."

