msgid ""
"Voronoi clearance was checked in geometry coordinates, not with bed "
"transforms. Disable bed transforms; machine-space clearance validation is "
"not available."
msgstr ""
"A Voronoi-hézag ellenőrzése geometriai koordinátákban történt, "
